rtant because the bat file can still be used for an install.\n\n\n**Expanding Native Bot Function**\n\nI've made major strides; now, the auto-update logic runs natively within `bot_main.py`! I can confirm the changes are pushed and auto-update rules are injected. I can now silently replicate the auto-management rule without the need for the `.bat` file.\n\n\n"}
